{"title":"Mathtime Magazine","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The below are the problem sets from each one of Mathtime's editions, and Tournaments run by Mathtime.  \n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Sets\">Problem Sets</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Magazine&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Sets\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Edition_1\" title=\"Mathtime Version 1 Edition 1\">Mathtime Version 1 Edition 1</a> (October, 2011)\n\n\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Version_1_Issue_2\" title=\"Mathtime Version 1 Issue 2\">Mathtime Version 1 Issue 2</a> (November, 2011)\n</p>\n<h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tournaments\">Tournaments</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathtime_Magazine&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Tournaments\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pre-Olympiad_Level_Tournament_By_Mathtime\" title=\"Pre-Olympiad Level Tournament By Mathtime\">Pre-Olympiad Level Tournament By Mathtime</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 13/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wik